OL,3,ACrypto giant Binance hit by $6.3bn hack
OL,4,Athought to be largest in history
OL,5,
OL,6,FBinance, the world's biggest crypto
OL,7,Fexchange, has been hit by what's
OL,8,Fthought to be the biggest hack in
OL,9,Fhistory at $6.3bn (#4.7bn) - here's
OL,10,Fwhat we know so far
OL,12,FThe company's co-CEO Richard Teng says
OL,13,Finitial investigations suggest a
OL,14,F"compromised DevOps engineer's laptop"
OL,15,Fgave hackers access - but adds the
OL,16,F"complex attack" was not a "single
OL,17,F'one-click' action"
OL,19,FTeng also tells customers their "money
OL,20,Fis safe, and we're covering every loss"
OL,21,F- read his statement in full
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
